.*
.* QTOCRTE: CFGTCP option 2, the IPv4 routes. WRKRTE has every option,
.* WRKRTED only 5=Display; F11 steps through three views. DSPRTE is
.* option 5.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ADRCL BASETYPE='CHAR 15'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TOSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=STSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 26'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VIEWCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=RTEDEST CLASS=ADRCL.
:VAR NAME=RTEMASK CLASS=ADRCL.
:VAR NAME=RTEHOP CLASS=ADRCL.
:VAR NAME=RTEIFC CLASS=ADRCL.
:VAR NAME=RTETOS CLASS=TOSCL.
:VAR NAME=RTESTS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=RTETEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=VIEW CLASS=VIEWCL VALUE='1'.
:VAR NAME=DDEST CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DMASK CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DTOS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DHOP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DIFC CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DMTU CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DDUP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DMETRIC CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DREDST CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=RTES VARS='OPT RTEDEST RTEMASK RTEHOP RTEIFC RTETOS RTESTS RTETEXT'.
:COND NAME=VIEW1 EXPR='&VIEW. EQ "1"'.
:COND NAME=VIEW2 EXPR='&VIEW. EQ "2"'.
:COND NAME=VIEW3 EXPR='&VIEW. EQ "3"'.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/WRKKEYS' NAME=WRKKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F6 ACTION='RETURN 6'.F6=Print list
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=VIEW1.F11=Display type of service
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=VIEW2.F11=Display text description
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=VIEW3.F11=Display next hop
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION='RETURN 17'.F17=Top
:KEYI KEY=F18 ACTION='RETURN 18'.F18=Bottom
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/DSPKEYS' NAME=DSPKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKRTE HELP=HLPRTE KEYL=WRKKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with TCP/IP Routes
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=RTES SCROLL=YES VIEWS=3 ACTLEN=1 EXTACT=YES.(No routes)
:LISTACT HELP='WRKRTE/OPTIONS' OPTION=1 ACTFOR=EXTACT ENTER='CMD ?ADDTCPRTE RTEDEST(''&RTEDEST.'')'.1=Add
:LISTACT HELP='WRKRTE/OPTIONS' OPTION=2 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='RETURN 102'.2=Change
:LISTACT HELP='WRKRTE/OPTIONS' OPTION=4 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='RETURN 104'.4=Remove
:LISTACT HELP='WRKRTE/OPTIONS' OPTION=5 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='RETURN 105'.5=Display
:LISTCOL HELP='WRKRTE/OPT' VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/RTEDEST' VAR=RTEDEST USAGE=OUTPUT EXTACT=YES.Route Destination
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/RTEMASK' VAR=RTEMASK USAGE=OUTPUT.Subnet          Mask
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/RTEHOP' VAR=RTEHOP USAGE=OUTPUT.Next            Hop
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/RTEIFC' VAR=RTEIFC USAGE=OUTPUT.Preferred Interface
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/RTETOS' VAR=RTETOS USAGE=OUTPUT.Type of Service
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/RTESTS' VAR=RTESTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Route           Status
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/RTETEXT' VAR=RTETEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT RTEDEST RTEMASK RTEHOP RTEIFC'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT RTEDEST RTEMASK RTEHOP RTETOS'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT RTEDEST RTEMASK RTETEXT'.
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKRTED HELP=HLPRTE KEYL=WRKKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with TCP/IP Routes
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=RTES SCROLL=YES VIEWS=3 ACTLEN=1 EXTACT=YES.(No routes)
:LISTACT HELP='WRKRTED/OPTIONS' OPTION=5 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='RETURN 105'.5=Display
:LISTCOL HELP='WRKRTED/OPT' VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/RTEDEST' VAR=RTEDEST USAGE=OUTPUT EXTACT=YES.Route Destination
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/RTEMASK' VAR=RTEMASK USAGE=OUTPUT.Subnet          Mask
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/RTEHOP' VAR=RTEHOP USAGE=OUTPUT.Next            Hop
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/RTEIFC' VAR=RTEIFC USAGE=OUTPUT.Preferred Interface
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/RTETOS' VAR=RTETOS USAGE=OUTPUT.Type of Service
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/RTESTS' VAR=RTESTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Route           Status
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/RTETEXT' VAR=RTETEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT RTEDEST RTEMASK RTEHOP RTEIFC'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT RTEDEST RTEMASK RTEHOP RTETOS'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT RTEDEST RTEMASK RTETEXT'.
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPRTE HELP=HLPDSP KEYL=DSPKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display TCP/IP Route
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATACOL WIDTH=40.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DDEST' VAR=DDEST USAGE=OUTPUT.Route destination
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DMASK' VAR=DMASK USAGE=OUTPUT.Subnet mask
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DTOS' VAR=DTOS USAGE=OUTPUT.Type of service
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DHOP' VAR=DHOP USAGE=OUTPUT.Next hop
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DIFC' VAR=DIFC USAGE=OUTPUT.Preferred binding interface
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DMTU' VAR=DMTU USAGE=OUTPUT.Maximum transmission unit
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DDUP' VAR=DDUP USAGE=OUTPUT.Duplicate route priority
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DMETRIC' VAR=DMETRIC USAGE=OUTPUT.Route metric
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DREDST' VAR=DREDST USAGE=OUTPUT.Route redistribution
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DTEXT' VAR=DTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text description
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPRTE.Work with TCP/IP Routes - Help
:P.The IPv4 routes: where each leads, through which next hop and
interface. F11 shows their type of service, then their text. Type an
option next to a route to change, remove or display it; option 1 adds
one.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPDSP.Display TCP/IP Route - Help
:P.One route's configuration.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/WRKKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F5=Refresh
:PD.Shows the display again with the current information.
:PT.F6=Print list
:PD.Print list.
:PT.F11=Display type of service
:PD.Display type of service.
:PT.F11=Display text description
:PD.Display text description.
:PT.F11=Display next hop
:PD.Display next hop.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F17=Top
:PD.Moves to the top of the list.
:PT.F18=Bottom
:PD.Moves to the bottom of the list.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKRTE/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RTEDEST'.Route Destination
:P.The route Destination of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RTEMASK'.Subnet          Mask
:P.The subnet Mask of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RTEHOP'.Next            Hop
:P.The next Hop of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RTEIFC'.Preferred Interface
:P.The preferred Interface of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RTETOS'.Type of Service
:P.The type of Service of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RTESTS'.Route           Status
:P.The route Status of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RTETEXT'.Text
:P.The text of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKRTE/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.1=Add
:PD.Type 1 next to an entry and press Enter to add it. The Add TCP/IP
Route (ADDTCPRTE) command is prompted for the entry.
:PT.2=Change
:PD.Type 2 next to an entry and press Enter to change it.
:PT.4=Remove
:PD.Type 4 next to an entry and press Enter to remove it.
:PT.5=Display
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display it.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKRTED/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKRTED/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.5=Display
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display it.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/DSPKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DDEST'.Route destination
:P.The route destination shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DMASK'.Subnet mask
:P.The subnet mask that tells the network part of the address from the
host part.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DTOS'.Type of service
:P.The type of service shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DHOP'.Next hop
:P.The next hop shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DIFC'.Preferred binding interface
:P.The preferred binding interface shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DMTU'.Maximum transmission unit
:P.The maximum transmission unit shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DDUP'.Duplicate route priority
:P.The duplicate route priority shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DMETRIC'.Route metric
:P.The route metric shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DREDST'.Route redistribution
:P.The route redistribution shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DTEXT'.Text description
:P.The text description shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
